      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ForWard Proxy -> It acts as a assitant that sit in front of the client and forward thier request to internet .\nThe Desitination server can never see the clinet ip it always see the Forward proxy ip . \n\n\n\n",
      "rawText": "ForWard Proxy -> It acts as a assitant that sit in front of the client and forward thier request to internet .\nThe Desitination server can never see the clinet ip it always see the Forward proxy ip . \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ForWard Proxy -> It acts as a assitant that sit in front of the client and forward thier request to internet .\nThe Desitination server can never see the clinet ip it always see the Forward proxy ip . \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
