      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789235401892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Transaparent Proxy -> Transpatent CLient Doesnt know it has a \nTransparent Proxy .\nIts a proxy that intercepts client traffic over the network \n\nReal World Example -> Connect to public wifi that means \nyou most likeley to get exposed to Transparent Proxy \n\nIts diff from Forward proxy as in that client usually is aware that\nthere is a proxy example in case of VPN. \n\nClient -> Thinking its talking directly to server -> Network -> Transparent proxy -> Destination server",
      "rawText": "Transaparent Proxy -> Transpatent CLient Doesnt know it has a \nTransparent Proxy .\nIts a proxy that intercepts client traffic over the network \n\nReal World Example -> Connect to public wifi that means \nyou most likeley to get exposed to Transparent Proxy \n\nIts diff from Forward proxy as in that client usually is aware that\nthere is a proxy example in case of VPN. \n\nClient -> Thinking its talking directly to server -> Network -> Transparent proxy -> Destination server",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transaparent Proxy -> Transpatent CLient Doesnt know it has a \nTransparent Proxy .\nIts a proxy that intercepts client traffic over the network \n\nReal World Example -> Connect to public wifi that means \nyou most likeley to get exposed to Transparent Proxy \n\nIts diff from Forward proxy as in that client usually is aware that\nthere is a proxy example in case of VPN. \n\nClient -> Thinking its talking directly to server -> Network -> Transparent proxy -> Destination server",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
