      "text": "API GATEWAY \n1. API Composition -> Basically feature of API gateway \n\n\nusecase \nClient mobile access the netflix than show limited data \n    limited api calls as mobile has low bandwidth \n\nclient PC : access the netflix than show more data \n    , more api calls as pc has high bandwidth.\n\n2. Authentication -> \n\n\n",
      "rawText": "API GATEWAY \n1. API Composition -> Basically feature of API gateway \n\n\nusecase \nClient mobile access the netflix than show limited data \n    limited api calls as mobile has low bandwidth \n\nclient PC : access the netflix than show more data \n    , more api calls as pc has high bandwidth.\n\n2. Authentication -> \n\n\n",
